<title>BELGIUM: EU economic forecast for Italy.</title>
<headline>EU economic forecast for Italy.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Italy:</p>
<p>				     1996	 1997</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		0.8	   1.4</p>
<p> Investment			2.2	   4.4</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)    3.9	   2.9</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    12.1	 12.3</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	 6.6	   3.3</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)  Debt/GDP ratio		 123.4	122.3</p>
</text>
